From 5ca6b953c9567876a5ae055bac437f4396bdfe0a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 02:39:04 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] kanban: every card read says where a ready card
 waits (queue + unplaceable), self-heal kanban-7d720d4ab8

Problem: 2026-11-02 rollout card t_01a19400313cfbda sat ready 37 min (hub at 7/7 with priority>=1 cards ahead).
The chat read kanban_show, saw queue_reason null, called it "still queued despite no remaining dependencies" and
ran the card's work in a background subagent outside the dispatcher. Separately t_01a1a521638d0a78
(runs_on ["hermes-hub"], a label no machine carries) has sat ready since 2026-11-04 with nothing on the card.
Why 1: the dispatcher fills slots by priority then age under max_in_progress (kanban_db_dispatch_queries).
Why 2: kanban_show returned only queue_reason (worker-pool answers); a hub-slot wait reads null.
Why 3: b1f608189c0 put kanban_queue_position on the REST read only; e705d05c715 added a prose queue_hint to the
  tool after 30 min; `hermes kanban show` had neither.
Why 4: position() never looked at runs_on, so an unplaceable card read as a local slot wait, and the dispatcher's
  labels_mismatch skip lived only in the tick result.
Root (happened): the queue answer was per-surface, not one shared read every card surface emits.
Root (not caught): tests covered REST only; nothing checked surfaces agree.

- kanban_queue_position.placement(): on a synced board with a known registry, runs_on this machine does not
  satisfy reads {lane: machine, machines} or, when no machine does, {lane: unplaceable, missing, machines}.
  Unknown/unreachable registry never reads unplaceable.
- describe(): one line ("waiting for a local slot: ~N ahead, R/L running. queued, not stuck ... do not run its
  work outside the dispatcher ... raise its priority").
- kanban_show tool and `hermes kanban show` (--json and text) carry `queue` + `queue_note` for every ready card.
- Dispatcher eligible_rows writes one skipped_unplaceable event per unchanged condition.
- tests/tools/test_kanban_show_queue.py: tool, CLI JSON/text, unplaceable/machine/local/unknown-registry, a
  REST==tool==CLI parity test, and the once-only event. RED 9/10 on d5566cffa9d, GREEN 10/10.
---
